<title>LATVIA: BIDS FOR GRINDEX DUE BY JULY 8, AGENCY SAYS.</title>
<headline>BIDS FOR GRINDEX DUE BY JULY 8, AGENCY SAYS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The privatisation agency on Thursday said it will accept offers to take part in the second stage of the privatisation of pharmaceuticals firm Grindex until July 8.</p>
<p>In a statement, the agency said that the auction will take place on July 19.</p>
<p>The agency plans to boost the share capital of the group to 5.95 million lats from 4.4 million lats. Some 26 percent will be sold for privatisation vouchers and 34 percent to a strategic investor, the agency has decided.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
